  promptText: Settlers are burning ancient olive trees that hold community memory.
    Documenting the attacks could build evidence and spur action, but public exposure
    may invite dangerous reprisals against my family.
  leftAnswer: A record of events can force accountability, even at personal risk.
  rightAnswer: Protecting your family now preserves safety and care for loved ones.
